# Bun configuration - replaces .npmrc functionality where applicable
# Note: shamefully-hoist and virtual-store-dir are pnpm-specific
# Bun uses a flat node_modules structure by default

# These settings are handled differently in bun:
# - shamefully-hoist=true -> Bun always hoists
# - virtual-store-dir-max-length -> Not applicable in bun
# - public-hoist-pattern -> Bun hoists everything
# - only-built-dependencies -> Not directly supported, but bun builds only what's needed

# For electron/esbuild/meta-json-schema, bun will handle builds automatically
